# Pathfinding & Navigation

## Layer split

| Layer | Project | Responsibility |
|-------|---------|----------------|
| Grid math, A*, smoothing | `Core/Pathfinding/` | `AStar`, `PathPlanner`, `TerrainCellReader`, `MapProjection` |
| Targets, replan, UI paths | `Overlay/Navigation/` | `NavigationPathBuilder`, `BackgroundReplanner`, `RouteTracker`, `AtlasRoutePolylineBuilder` |

Core must not reference Overlay types.

## Coordinates

- Grid ↔ world scale: `Poe2.WorldToGridRatio` (250/23 ≈ 10.87).
- Map projection: isometric `MapProjection` — not atlas UI projection (`UiElementProjection` / `AtlasHomography` are separate).

## Nav targets

- Stable string ids: `t:<path>` tiles, `e:<entityId>` entities.
- `MatchKey` for auto-nav pattern matching (`AutoNavPatterns`).
- Max 8 color slots for selected paths — respect cap in UI and auto-path filler.

## Planning cadence

- Heavy replans on world thread or `BackgroundReplanner` — not every render frame.
- Cache paths per target; invalidate on zone change or large player movement per existing replan policy.

## Atlas routes

- Node graph from validated offsets (`AtlasGraph.ConnectionsVec`, `AtlasNode.GridPos`).
- Screen positions via live zoom/pan model — not perspective homography.
